# NOTE: Explicit lock files (win-x64.txt, etc) are deprecated in favor of environment YAML files.
# The explicit lock format is fragile across channels and platform updates.
# 
# RECOMMENDED: Use the YAML files for platform-specific installation:
# 
# For Windows (win64_updated.yml):
#   conda env create -f envs/win64_updated.yml
#   
# For Linux (linux64_env.yml):
#   conda env create -f envs/linux64_env.yml
#   
# For macOS (winx64_env.yml, cross-platform):
#   conda env create -f envs/winx64_env.yml
#
# Or use the recommended installation command from README.md:
#   conda create -n mdpertool -c conda-forge -c bio-otto python=3.11 mdpertool
